{"sha": "299f7a0398498cf367f0db0204a351cb1edf5dcd8750567667bd73f5a8b88a3f", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}, y=0.0058cm]", "  \\def\\lw{5.0}", "  % levels (kJ/mol relative to Na(s) + 1/2 Cl2(g))", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (\\lw,0) node[right] {\\ce{Na(s) + 1/2Cl2(g)}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,107.5) -- (\\lw,107.5) node[right] {\\ce{Na(g) + 1/2Cl2(g)}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,228.8) -- (\\lw,228.8) node[right] {\\ce{Na(g) + Cl(g)}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,724.6) -- (\\lw,724.6) node[right] {\\ce{Na+(g) + e- + Cl(g)}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,376.1) -- (\\lw,376.1) node[right] {\\ce{Na+(g) + Cl-(g)}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,-411.1) -- (\\lw,-411.1) node[right] {氯化钠 \\ce{NaCl(s)}};", "  % the path through the elements, on the left", "  \\draw[->, omDef] (0.4,0) -- (0.4,107.5);", "  \\node[omDef, left, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.35,53) {升华 $107.5$};", "  \\draw[->, omDef] (0.4,107.5) -- (0.4,228.8);", "  \\node[omDef, left, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.35,168) {$\\tfrac12$ 解离 $121.3$};", "  \\draw[->, omDef] (0.4,228.8) -- (0.4,724.6);", "  \\node[omDef, left, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.35,480) {钠的电离 $495.8$};", "  \\draw[->, omThm] (1.4,724.6) -- (1.4,376.1);", "  \\node[omThm, right, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.45,560) {电子附着 $-348.6$};", "  \\draw[->, omProp] (2.3,0) -- (2.3,-411.1);", "  \\node[omProp, left, font=\\footnotesize] at (2.25,-205) {生成焓 $-411.1$};", "  % the lattice enthalpy, the only unknown", "  \\draw[->, thick] (3.6,-411.1) -- (3.6,376.1);", "  \\node[right, font=\\footnotesize] at (3.65,-205) {晶格焓 $787$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 氯化钠在 \\qty{298}{K} 时的玻恩–哈伯循环", "（\\unit{kJ/mol}）。由晶体沿晶格焓上升至气态离子，", "或经单质绕行，都到达同一能级：", "晶格焓是该循环中唯一的未知量。}", "% ledger: dfh:NaCl_cr, dfh:Na_g, janaf:Cl, ie:Na, ea:Cl", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[玻恩–哈伯循环]\\label{met:b2:reaction-enthalpy:born-haber}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 从处于参考态的单质出发，画两条路径：一条", "        通向晶体（生成），另一条通向气态离子（金属", "        的升华、非金属的原子化、电离、电子", "        附着）。", "  \\item 以晶格焓闭合循环，由晶体上升至", "        气态离子。", "  \\item 写出循环中各焓变之和为零，", "        并解出未知量。电离能与电子亲和能", "        以每个原子的 eV 值列表给出，需乘以 $N_A e = \\qty{96.485}{kJ/(mol.eV)}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[氯化钠]\\label{ex:b2:reaction-enthalpy:nacl}", "$\\Delta_{\\text{晶格}}H^\\circ = 411.1 + 107.5 + 121.3 + 495.8 - 348.6 =", "\\qty{787}{kJ/mol}$。电离能与电子亲和能", "均为 \\qty{0}{K} 时的能量；修正到 \\qty{298}{K} 的修正项（各为 $+\\tfrac52RT$，", "每项）在两步间相互抵消。点电荷晶体模型", "给出相近的数值，这正是氯化钠被称为离子晶体的原因。", "% ledger: dfh:NaCl_cr, dfh:Na_g, janaf:Cl, ie:Na, ea:Cl (computed in figdata/bachelor-2/thermo-data.py)", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{反应焓与温度}", "", "表中给出 $\\Delta_f H^\\circ$ 在 \\qty{298.15}{K} 时的值。反应器的", "运行温度为 \\qty{700}{K}，火焰则为 \\qty{2000}{K}：$\\Delta_r H^\\circ$ 如何随", "温度变化？", "", "\\begin{theorem}[基尔霍夫定律]\\label{thm:b2:reaction-enthalpy:kirchhoff}", "\\[", "  \\frac{\\dd\\Delta_r H^\\circ}{\\dd T} = \\Delta_r C_p^\\circ =", "  \\sum_i\\nu_i C_{p,m,i}^\\circ ,", "\\]", "于是 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ(T_2) = \\Delta_r H^\\circ(T_1) + \\int_{T_1}^{T_2}", "\\Delta_r C_p^\\circ\\,\\dd T$（\\emph{基尔霍夫定律}\\index{基尔霍夫定律}），", "在 $T_1$ 与 $T_2$ 之间无相变时成立。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "各物种均处于标准态时，$H^\\circ(T, \\xi) = \\sum_in_i", "H^\\circ_{m,i}(T)$ 是两个变量的函数，其二阶偏导数", "连续；由施瓦茨定理，二者可交换：", "\\[", "  \\frac{\\dd\\Delta_r H^\\circ}{\\dd T} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial T}", "  \\frac{\\partial H^\\circ}{\\partial\\xi} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\xi}", "  \\frac{\\partial H^\\circ}{\\partial T} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\xi}", "  \\sum_in_iC^\\circ_{p,m,i} = \\sum_i\\nu_iC^\\circ_{p,m,i}.", "\\]", "对 $T_1$ 到 $T_2$ 积分即得第二式。若区间内", "某物种发生相变，则需计入其相变焓，", "并乘以化学计量数。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[高温下的合成氨]\\label{ex:b2:reaction-enthalpy:kirchhoff}", "对于 \\ce{N2(g) + 3H2(g) -> 2NH3(g)}，$\\Delta_r H^\\circ(298) =", "\\qty{-91.9}{kJ/mol}$，取 \\qty{298}{K} 时的热容，", "$\\Delta_r C_p^\\circ = 2(35.65) - 29.12 - 3(28.84) =", "\\qty{-44.3}{J/(K.mol)}$。若视为常数，则得 $\\Delta_r", "H^\\circ(700) = -91.9 - 0.0443 \\times 402 = \\qty{-109.7}{kJ/mol}$。表中", "数据考虑了热容随温度的增大，给出", "\\qty{-105.2}{kJ/mol}。恒定 $C_p$ 的估算偏差为 4\\,\\%，", "一步计算的合理代价。超过 \\qty{400}{K} 时，反应", "焓约变化七分之一。", "% ledger: dfh:NH3_g, cp:NH3_g.298, cp:N2_g.298, cp:H2_g.298, janafdfH:NH3.700 (computed in figdata/bachelor-2/thermo-data.py)", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{绝热反应与量热法}", "", "\\subsection*{火焰温度}", "", "火焰中反应很快，热量来不及散出：", "气体自身被加热。", "", "\\begin{definition}[绝热火焰温度]\\label{def:b2:reaction-enthalpy:flame-temperature}", "燃料的\\emph{绝热火焰温度}\\index{绝热火焰温度}，是指", "其完全燃烧产物所达到的温度，", "即在恒压、无任何热量交换的条件下进行反应，", "且反应物初始温度为 \\qty{298}{K}。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}